- test-maker: fix AC1 (mission.progress = {pending:1,total:1}), AC2 (runtime
  index outside the `as` cast; mission.progress = {in_progress:1,total:1}),
  AC9 (legal transition chain), AC10 (use a rollup-changing write),
  AC11 (deterministic lock observation). Re-run full suite.
- coder: NO action — implementation verified spec-faithful on all five points.
- escalate: not needed; nothing pre-existing or out-of-scope found.

nQ: round 1 consumed of 3. If the suite is still red after round 3, escalate
to the human via concierge.
